  "reflectionText": "Simeon held the child in his arms and said: now you are releasing your servant, Master, in peace. Anna came up at the same hour and gave thanks. What is the quiet of recognizing in the small bundle in your arms the One you have been waiting your whole life to be allowed to see at all?"
